# Canonicalises names in `git shortlog -sne`, `git log --use-mailmap`, and most
# git-based contribution tools.
#
# The human author has committed under two spellings; Claude has co-authored
# under one per model version ("Claude Sonnet 5", "Claude Opus 4.8", …), which
# would otherwise read as four separate contributors.
#
# Note this does NOT change github.com's own contributors graph — that matches
# on the commit email against a registered GitHub account, and
# noreply@anthropic.com belongs to no account. See README, "Contributors".

